## Interface: 16001
## Title: TalentPath
## Notes: Follows a Wowhead talent order. Paste a talent calculator link for each spec into the box under the talent window, and the window marks the next talents to take; it warns you instead if your talents leave the order. With Upkeep, the next talent also shows as a reminder.
## Author: Martin
## Version: 1.0.0
## OptionalDeps: Upkeep
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: TalentPathCharDB

